				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;accordion mt-2&#34; id=&#34;release-83657c70317637f5217b9aeefa3af582-page-0_accordion&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;accordion-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;accordion-header&#34; id=&#34;release-83657c70317637f5217b9aeefa3af582-page-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button&#xA;        class=&#34;accordion-button&#34;&#xA;        type=&#34;button&#34;&#xA;        data-bs-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34;&#xA;        data-bs-target=&#34;#release-83657c70317637f5217b9aeefa3af582-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;        aria-expanded=&#34;true&#34;&#xA;        aria-controls=&#34;release-83657c70317637f5217b9aeefa3af582-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;      &gt;Changelog&lt;span class=&#34;badge rounded-pill bg-secondary ms-1&#34;&gt;133&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&#xA;      id=&#34;release-83657c70317637f5217b9aeefa3af582-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;      class=&#34;accordion-collapse collapse show&#34;&#xA;      aria-labelledby=&#34;release-83657c70317637f5217b9aeefa3af582-page-0&#34;&#xA;      data-bs-parent=&#34;#release-83657c70317637f5217b9aeefa3af582-page-0_accordion&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;accordion-body&#34;&gt;&lt;ul class=&#34;list-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;          &lt;li class=&#34;list-group-item my-auto&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;Render site diagrams with native Mermaid themes&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Documentation diagrams follow the site&amp;rsquo;s light/dark selector with compact&#xA;Dagre layouts, rounded boxes and captions, smooth connector bends, and&#xA;embedded sans-serif labels. Increase nested-container clearance while&#xA;reducing node/rank gaps. Print uses light; historical blog diagrams retain&#xA;their original files and presentation.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Derive both palettes from the shared Sass tokens and configure Mermaid&#xA;before rendering. A small pinned Mermaid patch exposes Dagre edge spacing,&#xA;including nested subgraphs. Write SVG output unchanged, without custom&#xA;routing or SVG post-processing. Keep the legacy renderer for blog assets.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
